  "description": "New version of su_ModernAlert package. A Windows Forms library for modern and customizable alert windows. Enables you to create animated, customizable, and easy-to-use alert windows. Contains all features of su_ModernAlert package and future developments will continue on this package.\n\nIMPORTANT: If you are using su_ModernAlert package, please migrate to this package. See the readme.md file for migration instructions.",
